    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "programmed not to like to talk about\nmoney. Certainly don't want to ask for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661360,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "money. You don't want to ask strangers\nfor money. So, we don't even realize we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664400,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have all this subconscious program\nsubconscious program that's against"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668160,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "selling.\n\u003e\u003e Mhm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669280,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And even sales people have subconscious\nprogramming against selling. They say,",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673400,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you've probably heard this phrase,\n\"People love to buy, but they hate to be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676160,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sold.\" Well, I think that's the dumbest\nthing I've ever heard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679760,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the dumbest That's That doesn't\nmake any sense. Peop- I believe people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682960,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "love to buy and they love to be sold.\n\u003e\u003e Mhm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684800,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e But they hate to be convinced.\n\u003e\u003e Mhm.",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686520,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And convincing is what people in sales\nwho are not good at sales resort to",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689839,
    "dDurationMs": 5041,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they're so bad at sales.\n\u003e\u003e What's the difference between convincing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "someone versus selling someone?\n\u003e\u003e Great question. Selling is persuasion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698360,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Convincing is when I attempt to get you\nto do something I want you to do for my"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701760,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reasons.\n\u003e\u003e Mhm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703280,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I call that having commission breath.\nRight?",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705840,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Mhm.\n\u003e\u003e But persuasion is when I help you make a",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709720,
    "dDurationMs": 7240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "decision you already desire to make for\nyour own reasons. Now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715320,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have you ever in your life, and maybe\nyou don't now, but have you ever in your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718200,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "life had a \"When I get enough money, I'm\ngoing to get one of these\" list?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721560,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Uh-huh.\n\u003e\u003e Right? Pretty much everybody has a list",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724400,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like that, right? \"When I get enough\nmoney, I'm going to get one of these.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726680,
    "dDurationMs": 6920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Want to buy a car or watch or this or\n\u003e\u003e or ring or house or",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730440,
    "dDurationMs": 8920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whatever. Vacation, whatever. Right. So,\nI realized one day that there are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736160,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "millions of people in the world, or at\nleast thousands, tens of thousands,"
