  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741200,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "potentially hundreds of thousands, but I\nbelieve millions, tens of millions of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743560,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people in the world who would love to\nbuy what I'd love to sell if they only"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746640,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "knew I existed.\n\u003e\u003e Mhm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748160,
    "dDurationMs": 8160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And so, what most people in business do,\nand most people in sales do, is they go",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753920,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and look for people to sell stuff to.\nAnd people ask me that all the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757280,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Mark, how do I find people to sell\nstuff to?\" You're asking the wrong"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759520,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "question. How can you expect to get the\nright answer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762240,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The better question is, how can I make\nmyself more findable for people who"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765880,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "already want to buy what I already want\nto sell? The reality is if you've ever"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769560,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bought anything, you bought it because\nit was sold to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771920,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Mhm.\n\u003e\u003e The people Now,",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 774200,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the people who are best in the world at\nsales do a use a concept I call seamless"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778480,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "selling, which means they will sell you\nsomething,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781720,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they will make you think it is your\nidea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783920,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e If you are down to your last dollar,\n\u003e\u003e Right.",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786920,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e and or in that space where you feel like\nI'm really lacking. I'm in debt, a month",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791560,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a month, whatever it is, paycheck to\npaycheck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793520,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Right.\n\u003e\u003e And you have this thing that you're",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795800,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trying to sell.\n\u003e\u003e Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797600,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e How do you not feel so needy when you're\nlike, \"I really need this commission",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801760,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right now, or I really need this person\nto buy because I'm not going to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804960,
    "dDurationMs": 6280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "survive.\" So, how do I make it so\nconvincing that they need this or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809000,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "persuasive that it's for them rather\nthan"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811640,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yep.\n\u003e\u003e I really need this. So, so you have to",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814320,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "work with human nature instead of\nworking against it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817960,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And human nature works like this.\nIf I chase, you run."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822840,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I run, you chase.\nIf I lean in, you lean out. If I lean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826760,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out, you lean in.\nAnd so, if you have the you have to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829680,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "first begin with an awareness. Okay,\nawareness of what? An awareness that I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834160,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't have to make this sale. I have to\nmake a sale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838240,
    "dDurationMs": 6760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, I don't have to make this sale. If\nI understand the principle, principles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842280,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are like they don't they don't lie. They\nalways tell the truth. And so, if I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847000,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "understand the principle of the law of\naverages,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849720,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I understand that everybody in sales\nhas an average including me. This is how"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852880,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got good at sales, by the way. I knew\nI had an average."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855680,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e What do you mean an average? You mean\n\u003e\u003e If you talk to X number of people, X",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858560,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "number of people are going to buy. A\ncertain number are going to buy. Let's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860600,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "say let's say let's say your average is\none out of 10. So, if your average is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863920,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one out of 10, every time you you talk\nto somebody, somebody's going to buy on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866480,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "average, right?\nSo, if I know I'm going to talk to 10"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 869400,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people today, I don't care which one\nbuys."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870960,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Interesting.\n\u003e\u003e Right? So, now I can I can emotionally",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874240,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lean out because I don't need to make\nthis sale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877720,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And me being leaned out, if you desire\nthe thing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881720,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "makes you more inclined to desire it\nfrom me than somebody who's chasing you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887240,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah, you're you're more resistant to\npeople chasing you.",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889400,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Exactly.\nSee, because",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892640,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if I if I'm if I'm selling Earth I'm\nselling If if a man is dating a woman, a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897120,
    "dDurationMs": 6719,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "woman's dating a man, doesn't matter.\nBoy meets girl, it doesn't matter. If I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900760,
    "dDurationMs": 6280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "am making you feel like\nI need you, you believe you don't need"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905680,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "me.\nBut, if I can make you feel like you I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 908760,
    "dDurationMs": 7320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't need you,\nthen you believe you do need me. Now, in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 913680,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "order for me to make you feel like I\ndon't need you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917280,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e How do you do\n\u003e\u003e I need to feel like I don't need you.",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919360,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e How do you do that?\n\u003e\u003e By realizing I've got a law of averages,",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923040,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I have to make X number of sales,\nbut you don't have to be one of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926840,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if I realize that, you know what?\nIt's a privilege to work with me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 930160,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm one of the few people in the world\nthat have your best interest in mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933720,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like who will sell you something and and\nbe happy as a lark in the park if you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938920,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "say no.\nBecause people say, \"Well, that's easy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 941880,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for you to say cuz you have money.\"\nBut no, I have money because that's easy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944800,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for me to say. And it's easy for me to\nsay cuz it's easy for me to feel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947440,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because if I'm selling something to you\nand it's not in your best interest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951240,
    "dDurationMs": 7160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you say no, I'm glad for your sake\nand my sake you said no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955960,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm doing an event in\nOrange County, right? This weekend,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 960800,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tomorrow and the next day. And I ask\nyou, I said, \"Why don't you come up and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963000,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "speak?\" You're like, \"Where is it?\" I\nsaid it's Orange County. You're like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 965520,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"No, that's too far.\" And when you said,\n\"No, that's too far,\" like it made"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968480,
    "dDurationMs": 6760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "perfect sense to me. Right? And I kind\nof picked and teased a little bit. Of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972880,
    "dDurationMs": 7800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "course. But but but it made perfect\nsense. I wouldn't want you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 977560,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to have to deal with like an hour and a\nhalf of traffic and come speak at my"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982160,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "event and empower a bunch of people and\nthen have to deal with an hour and a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984560,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "half of traffic coming back and then you\nfeel yucky about that experience and now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988560,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
