    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "churches would give me an offering.\n\u003e\u003e Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1709280,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And then I had my tape ministry, where\nI'd have my sermons on recording, and I",
