    "dDurationMs": 8400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "honorarium. That week I made $2,100 from\nmy network marketing company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1735920,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I sold 21 I sold $2,100 worth of\ntapes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1740480,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Wow.\n\u003e\u003e But when I did that, you got to",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1742560,
    "dDurationMs": 7080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "understand, in 1998 I only made $48,000.\nSo that's an average of 4,000 a month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1747160,
    "dDurationMs": 7560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I made $6,200 in 1 week simply\nbecause I shifted my focus to acquiring"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1752800,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "assets and building assets. Now, here's\nwhat happened next. As soon as I made"
