  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1756520,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the 60 I said I made $6,200 [laughter]\nthis week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1759120,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First thing I said was wow.\nI said it backwards. I said wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1762625,
    "dDurationMs": 3415,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e [laughter]\n\u003e\u003e You're like, now how do I do this again?",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1764440,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Exactly. Well, before I even said how I\ndo this again, I said, that was so easy.",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1768480,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Mhm.\n\u003e\u003e And then I somehow or another",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1771880,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had this idea, this thought that must\nmean it's easier to make a lot of money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1776040,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a short period of time than it is to\nmake a little money over a long period"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1778320,
    "dDurationMs": 6520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of time. As soon as I said that, I said\nit out loud. I said"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1782600,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from now on for the rest of my life\nI'm going to ignore all the hard ways to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1786160,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make a little bit of money\nand I'm only going to focus on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1789800,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the easy ways to make a lot.\n\u003e\u003e Mhm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1792240,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e That shift changed my life. By July of\nthat same year I made $8,000 in 1 day in",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1796320,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the stock market.\n\u003e\u003e Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1798040,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Just because I decided to believe\n\u003e\u003e Mhm.",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1801920,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e that it's easier to make a lot of money\nin a short period of time than it is to",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1805560,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make a little money over a long period\nof time. And so even though even though"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1809600,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "financially since that time I've been\nbroke, I was aware of the fact"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1814680,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that\nit's easier to make a lot of money in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1817520,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "short period of time than it is to make\na little money over long period of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1819720,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So after that moment, you [snorts] had a\nnew belief, but you still became broke",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1823600,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "later is what I'm hearing you\n\u003e\u003e Like I I made millions of dollars and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1826560,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "became broke later.\n\u003e\u003e Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1828000,
    "dDurationMs": 7640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah. I had a whole series of situations\nthat started in 2007. My oldest son was",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1833920,
    "dDurationMs": 7320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a car accident and he passed away 4\ndays later. Most devastating, surreal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1839400,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "painful\nunbelievable, even to this day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1842920,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "experience of my life. How old was he?\nHe was 20."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1845520,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Oh, man.\n\u003e\u003e Yeah, it was",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1847280,
    "dDurationMs": 6760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was um yeah, he passed away 4 days\nlater. The next year, and I'm and not to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1851800,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "brush over that, but that was that that\nwill let a whole lot of wind out of your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1856640,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sails.\n\u003e\u003e Your whole life, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1858680,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Right, exactly. Even to this day, the\nmost difficult thing I've ever gone",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1862120,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through in my life.\nBy far."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1864600,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By leaps and bounds.\n\u003e\u003e Before you go on, what was the greatest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1867480,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lesson that taught you about life?\nLosing your son in that way. What was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1872160,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the greatest lesson that\n\u003e\u003e That taught me. That season taught you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1874400,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It showed me how much God loves me.\n\u003e\u003e Really?",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1876600,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah.\n\u003e\u003e How so?",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1877680,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e As a as a man, like a real man,\nyou want to protect your family, you",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1881920,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "want to provide for your family.\n\u003e\u003e Mhm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1884360,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And I had money. I had lots of money.\nMy money couldn't help me.",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1889440,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Mhm.\n\u003e\u003e And I'm sitting in the hospital room",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1891560,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "watching my son take his last breath.\n\u003e\u003e Oh my gosh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1895320,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And as hard as that was, you know what\nwas harder?",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1898320,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Watching my wife\nand my other son and my daughter watch"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1902280,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my wife's son and my other two\nchildren's brother, watching them watch"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1906320,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their brother die, watching my wife\nwatch her son die, and there's nothing I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1908960,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could do about it. And I would have done\nanything. I would have done anything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1911920,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "including trade places with him if I\nwould have had the opportunity. You say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1915520,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Well, how does that show you the love\nof God?\" Because God watched his son die"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1918680,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for me.\nAnd he could have done something about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1921200,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it, but he didn't.\nAnd that made me hyper aware of a kind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1925760,
    "dDurationMs": 6520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of love and a level of love that I have\nno ability to understand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1931080,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But all the ability in the world to\nappreciate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1933160,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Wow.\n\u003e\u003e So, that's the greatest lesson I",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1935160,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "learned.\n\u003e\u003e When did you learn to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1937840,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess appreciate or have awareness\naround the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1941800,
    "dDurationMs": 7200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the loss to where you could actually\nfeel love rather than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1946520,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anger, upset, or any other emotion. Cuz\nI don't know if that happened right away"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1950080,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for you. I'm assuming you\n\u003e\u003e No, that was that's what I had realized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1953360,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I was sitting there in that\nhospital room"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1956080,
    "dDurationMs": 7320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "watching experiencing this. That was my\nThat was what I was thinking about. God"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1960520,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "loves you. God loves me more than I can\never fathom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1965080,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e How do you even get to that I don't know\nif anyone could really think about that",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1967760,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in that moment of like, my son\n\u003e\u003e couldn't think about anything else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1971400,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Really?\n\u003e\u003e I couldn't think about anything else.",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1972920,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, you got to understand though, I\ncame to Christ when I was 16 years old."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1976160,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I started reading the Bible when I was\n16, the King James version. Started"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1979520,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reading the Bible when I was 16. Started\nstudying it when I was 20."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1983320,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And\nI had a very acute awareness already at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1987160,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that time that spirituality that the\ninvisible realm is the real realm and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1990760,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the physical realm is just the a\nmanifestation of that realm. So, I was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1994600,
    "dDurationMs": 7160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like that part of a that a level of\nawareness I already had."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2000080,
    "dDurationMs": 7720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And\nthere are some things other things that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2003480,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in my study that God had been showing me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2008000,
    "dDurationMs": 9720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "years leading up to that.\nThat put me in a position where"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2015000,
    "dDurationMs": 8240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that was the conclusion that I came to.\nIn fact, when my son died"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2020880,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as hard as it was and it was\nlike"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2025040,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can't it's I can't I can't describe\nhow hard it was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2028960,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, I wanted to make sure that I\npreached my son's funeral."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2032400,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Mhm.\n\u003e\u003e Because I didn't want somebody else to",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2034200,
    "dDurationMs": 7080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mess up what it meant. Because everybody\nin my family was going to have to live"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2038640,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with this conclusion for the rest of our\nlives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2042560,
    "dDurationMs": 8480,
