  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2553560,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah, yeah.\n\u003e\u003e But, it doesn't make the next moment",
