    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but maybe I would have lost it by now.\n\u003e\u003e Mhm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2656480,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Right? Like most of professional\nathletes do. And so, I believe that God",
