  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3428400,
    "dDurationMs": 6520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Right. In fact, when I was working for\nthe trash company, my the the general",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3433400,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "manager,\nthey would always see me on my break."
