    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6610040,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just go to a different place.\n\u003e\u003e Mhm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6613320,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And most people think the place they're\ngoing to go to is going to be determined",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6615680,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by if their good works outweigh their\nbad works,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6618920,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they get to go to a good place. If their\nbad works outweigh their good works,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6621920,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they get to go to a bad place.\n\u003e\u003e Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6625320,
    "dDurationMs": 7240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It's not how it works biblically.\nWhich brings me to the third point.",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6630800,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everybody needs a savior.\n\u003e\u003e Mhm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6633840,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e That's the whole point.\nIt's really interesting",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6638920,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that\neverything in the Bible points to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6642040,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Christ.\nBut everything in human history points"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6645480,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to Christ. What year is it?\nWhat year is this right now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6647840,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e 2026.\n\u003e\u003e What does 2026 mean?",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6651640,
    "dDurationMs": 7920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It means tw- tw- 2,026\nyears after our Lord. That's what it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6657320,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "means. Anno Dom- Anno Domini, after our\nLord."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6660680,
    "dDurationMs": 8400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our dates\nare based on the life of Christ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6664960,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's either before him or after him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6669120,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why? Because everything points to him.\n\u003e\u003e Mhm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6671720,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's beautiful.\n\u003e\u003e Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6673080,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e The final question, Myron, what's your\ndefinition of greatness?",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6676440,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Oh, that's easy.\nServe other people.",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6681040,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want to be great? Serve the most\npeople."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6683680,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He will be greatest among you. In fact,\nI did a video on that, too, called how"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6687120,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be great even if you're not good.\nHow can I be great even if I'm not good?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6690880,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Easy, serve more people. Jesus said,\n\"Who will be greatest among you? Let him"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6693920,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be servant of all.\"\nThink about it. Who do you want to spend"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6697720,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the most time with?\nSomebody who every time they're around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6701720,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you, they're trying to get something\nfrom you, or every time they're around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6704200,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you, they're looking for ways to make\nyour life better?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6706920,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's Greatness is not what you think\nyou are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6709680,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Greatness is what other people see you\nbeing as you serve other people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6714320,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Amen.\n\u003e\u003e So, my man. Thank you. Appreciate it.",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6717800,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Listen.\nIf you got big dreams, here's what I",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6720400,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "did. It was hard. [music] If you stick\nit out, it can happen to you as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6723640,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the concept of\nyou know, capitalism that most"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6728120,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "capitalists [music]\ntoday don't know how to sell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6730160,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "entrepreneurship like they used to back\nin the days. Today, they're embarrassed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6734360,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're ashamed.\nWe have to be comfortable selling that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6736960,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as well."
    } ]
  } ]
}
